Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 23:14:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Speed up block FP8 dequant on gfx90a

- Decode e4m3fn operands with a bit transform.
- Preserve NaN behavior and stock fallbacks.
- Select gfx90a from the input tensor device.
- Add focused eligibility coverage.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: gpt-5.6-sol-high

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
